Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: drop duplicate values and struct for Econet qdma

a good part of the original driver originated from the @cjdelisle driver,
a good part of QDMA was already present in the kernel,
just with some values that are different, in addition,
some common functions were also simplified

Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
